<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρόρειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>near a mountain</i> or <i>mountains</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.8.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.4.7
			</span></i> :—written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρόριος</span></b> , Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				20.490
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.190
			</span></i>.—The form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρώρειος</span> found in codd. (as in Str.l.c.) is incorrect,
			whereas <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρώρεια</span> (q.v.) is the only
			correct form of the Subst.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
